---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import r4tImage from "../../assets/images/r4t_image2.webp";
---

<section class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-black px-4 pt-12 pb-20 text-center">
  {/* Aviso Topo */}
  <div class="mt-4 mb-8">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-red-900/50 bg-red-950/40 px-4 py-1.5">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-brand-red"></span>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.15em] text-brand-red uppercase">
        TREINAMENTO 100% PRÁTICO
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Headline Principal - Foco na dor e na curiosidade */}
  <div class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-4xl space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl leading-tight font-black tracking-normal text-white md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.1] lg:text-6xl">
      COPIE E COLE ESSE PROJETO DE BAIXO CUSTO QUE GERA <span class="text-brand-red">32CV</span> E
      FAZ A MOTO PASSAR DOS{" "}
      <span class="relative z-10 ml-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-1.5 leading-none text-white italic">
        <span class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 -skew-x-12 rounded-md bg-brand-red"></span>200KM/H
      </span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-lg font-medium text-gray-400 md:text-xl">
      O passo a passo para preparar uma moto realmente forte para humilhar seus concorrentes e se
      tornar referência na sua cidade
    </p>
  </div>

  {/* Imagem de Destaque (Substituindo Vídeo) */}
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto mb-12 w-full max-w-4xl">
    <Image src={r4tImage} alt="Projeto R4T - 32cv" class="h-auto w-full" loading="eager" />
  </div>

  {/* Botão de Compra - Com animação de brilho (Shine) para maior CTR */}
  <div id="hero-cta-container" class="mx-auto mb-20 w-full max-w-md transition-all duration-1000">
    <a
      href="#oferta"
      class="group relative block w-full transform overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-brand-red px-6 py-5 text-xl font-black tracking-wider text-white uppercase shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,51,51,0.4)] transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-brand-red-dark hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(255,51,51,0.6)] md:text-2xl"
    >
      {/* Efeito de Brilho Correndo */}
      <div class="animate-shine absolute inset-0 h-full w-full -translate-x-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/30 to-transparent"></div>

      <span class="relative z-10">QUERO TER ACESSO AGORA</span>
    </a>
    <p class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
      <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-green-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          stroke-width="2"
          d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"
        ></path>
      </svg>
      Acesso imediato e seguro
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes shine {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(-100%);
    }
    20% {
      transform: translateX(100%);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateX(100%);
    }
  }
  .animate-shine {
    animation: shine 3s infinite;
  }
</style>
